	"label": "Transcribe Audio or Video",
	"description": "Transcribes the speech in an audio or video file. The transcript is in result_data of the finished job. Returns a job_id right away. Poll 'Get Job Status' (Rendley API) until Is Complete is true. The finished job has a signed download link in url and a media_id for 'Get Media Download URL'."
